The interface IFaultInjectionTransactionalState<GrainData> is not found in the repository paths I checked. I will try to write the tests with the assumption that PerformUpdate takes an Action<GrainData> and returns a Task, and PerformRead takes a Func<GrainData, TResult> and returns a Task<TResult>. I will also mock the FaultInjectionControl property on the data mock.

I will resubmit the tests with explicit type arguments for PerformUpdate and PerformRead calls and fix the mocking accordingly.

